   "shape_m": "ol",
   "html_text": "the claim that the ultimate reality consists of irreducible spatial units (e.g., atoms of the material category) and irreducible temporal units (e.g., point-instant consciousnesses) of the five basic categories, and the claim that the conventional reality consists of reducible spatial wholes or temporal continua.",
